{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_tachak_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_tachak_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "一如既往",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tachak_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "77cfec51c5e45e7309c1207bb9d1c1e3d9152c24c2f28c315b48c41fba71ec02",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“你收到这封信的时候，那边多半已经入冬了。”\n“乌萨斯的冬天想必更加恶劣。”\n“如果可以的话，我希望你能早一点回来。”\n“我希望你没有被卷入那边的乱局里。”\n“最后还有一句友善的提醒。”\n“我知道你做事的风格，但是别掺和太深。”\n“祝你好运，Lord。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“别掺和太深”么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在说这些，也没啥意义了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "亚历山大看着眼前的设备与工具，发出了一声长叹，默默地收起了那封信件。\n伴随着他的叹息，凝聚的水汽在空气中形成了一片薄雾。\n在他眼前摆放着一台造型古怪的设备，厚实的金属轨道上充满粗糙打磨的痕迹，未经抛光的板材略显浮锈。\n在古怪设备旁边，亚历山大小心谨慎地操作着用木头搭建的吊装工具，进行最后的作业。\n吊装台的麻绳上挂着一台源石发动机，也是眼前这台古怪设备的最后一块拼图。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "搞定！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "联轴器没什么问题，我的扳手呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "水平尺，我把水平尺丢哪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "魁梧的士兵从一旁的木箱里拿出了一把用桦木与小玻璃瓶自制的水平尺，尽可能地调整发动机与设备之间连接件的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "供能装置正常，电压......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这上哪儿能弄到电压表啊，凑合着用吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "五十年代的时候他们都是怎么造这些东西的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个扭矩......希望材料够结实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在数分钟的摆弄后，仓库里传出了阵阵机械的轰鸣声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈！哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "成功了！哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "动起来了！哈哈哈哈！动起来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亚历山大先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿尔苏先生，你来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么早你就在工作了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哟？这机器终于动起来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "值得庆祝啊！折腾了两个月，也算是没有白费功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜酒已经喝完了，不知道商队什么时候才来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这可不好说，一到冬天那些商队的人就不愿意走太远了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有了这台机器，就算是商队的人不来，我也可以自己加工一些简单的零件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比如，上次坏掉的那台手摇泵就可以修好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回头可以教教村里其他人怎么操作这台机器，会方便很多的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这种机器叫什么来着......机床？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前听我儿子聊过这些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说起来，我来这边这么久，还没见过你儿子呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他工作的地方虽然不远，但出了村子要翻一座山才能到，一到冬天山路就不好走，所以我很少让他回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "山的东边？那边确实有个矿区，好像是附近移动城市的附属地块。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亚历山大先生似乎对这附近的情况很熟悉啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前去和流民聚落交换物资的时候，我多打听了一点周围的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "过几天可能还得去一次，希望在此之前不要下大雪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这段时间你还是别去找那些荒地人了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "税官的队伍就要来了，要是让他们知道我们和荒地人做生意，要出大事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出大事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其他地方我不知道，但是费季索夫大人不允许我们和荒地人过多接触。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不准接触那些流民？为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前会有军队的人来宣传，说这些荒地流民很多都是卡西米尔来的间谍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有什么锈锤之类的暴徒混在里面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是我看那个荒地人聚落的居民大多都是乌萨斯人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前不是这样的......唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前些年根本没有这么多荒地流民，那时候的荒地人大多都是从乌萨斯以外的地方跑来的，很快就会被费季索夫大人的卫兵赶走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是现在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个流民聚落里的乌萨斯人，都是从其他村子逃跑的人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "比如咱们村，前些年还有两百多人呢，这两年都跑光了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佃农跑了，人越来越少，也没人种地，做生意的人也不来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "外加今年要交的税更高了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦哦，人口流失，这个我熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你们的领主呢？那位“费季索夫大人”就完全不管？自己领地里的佃农全跑了，他吃什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这......这我也不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过费季索夫大人应该还在忙着处理北边的流寇吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么还有流寇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦！是之前村里人说的那些土匪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "流寇这个称呼还真少见，这些“流寇”又是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这都一个月了，你们的领主还没解决这个问题？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "普通的土匪也不是乌萨斯军队的对手吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这我也不清楚，但是他们说那些流寇训练有素，专门打劫贵族的财产，还袭击了军队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不知道一群土匪是哪儿来的胆子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "训练有素、反抗贵族的“土匪”，这故事我还真听过，很耳熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不如说太熟悉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那句老话怎么说的来着？历史总是惊人地相似。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，亚历山大先生以前也经历过这种事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没什么，我瞎说的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爷子！老爷子！你怎么在这儿！他们都在找你呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喘口气，喘口气，有什么事慢慢说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，你快点回家，你儿子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我儿子回来了？今天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对啊......他怎么回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你快点过去吧！他出事了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿尔苏你可来了，你儿子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我儿子怎么了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早上我去整理木柴，结果在村南面看到有人倒在村口，吓我一跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走近一看才发现是安瓦尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幸亏发现得及时啊，要是再拖一阵，可就不好说了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "实在是太感谢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伤口我简单帮他包扎了一下，他身上没冻伤，我估计才倒在那没多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我只能说你可要准备好啊......你儿子，他好像感染了矿石病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他胳膊上......你自己看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这......这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人颤抖着后退了一步，一脸惊恐地看着自己的儿子。\n恐惧、担忧、疑虑的神情在短短几秒内闪过了他的脸庞。\n但是最终只剩下了悲痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其他人......其他人知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还没说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "求求您，您可......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，我知道，你就这一个儿子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这几天我会让大家别靠近你家，我就说你儿子身上有湿疫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "妇人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是这可是矿石病，你明白吧？你可得想清楚咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢您......谢谢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看起来情况不是很好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亚历山大先生！你怎么来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......你还是先出去......我儿子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "矿石病，是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......亚......亚历山大先生，这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，别紧张，我是来帮忙的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这可......亚历山大先生，这可是矿石病啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我接触过不少矿石病人，我不在乎这个，你放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把他上衣脱掉，把这个药涂在有结晶的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我说了，我之前接触过不少矿石病人，按我说的做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是注射用的药，你来帮我一把，我去弄一点热水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有这个，如果他身上的结晶有血渗出来，把血滴在这个试纸上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几分钟后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我这是在哪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安瓦尔！你醒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老......老爹？我怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，别说了，你回来了就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里是......在家里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对！我不能待在这，我有矿石病！我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道......我知道，别说了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你萨尼婶好心没有告诉其他人，也幸亏是她先发现了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等你伤好一点，我带你去林子里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那边有个猎人的小屋，废弃很久了，你就先住在那边吧，我们回头再想办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......老爹......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，别说了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你先休息吧，我去打点水，不要乱跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是......雇佣兵！为什么村子里会有雇佣兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别担心，我是你父亲的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的矿石病不严重，只是轻症。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前没见过你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也是今年才到这里来，你叫我亚历山大就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以到底发生什么事了，你不是在工厂那边工作吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "两周前......工厂的锅炉炸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和其他几个工人都感染了矿石病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后工厂的负责人就把我们都赶出去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就这样？没有人追你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一开始我们发现有人跟着我们......但是后来也没管那么多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这么轻易就放你们跑了，有点不对劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，你还是先歇着吧，别想那么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还好么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亚历山大先生......这......这可怎么办啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "答案只有一个，面对现实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可......这矿石病......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你儿子的矿石病是轻症，这种程度的轻症有很多办法延缓病情的发展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么这么了解这个病......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个就说来话长了，不过现在还有另一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在乌萨斯这个地方，就算是轻症，你儿子以后的生活也会非常艰难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就让他学会像荒地人那样活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔苏",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像是那些捕捉野生裂兽的猎人一样，他得学会怎么生活在荒野里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以教他一些东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一周后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "稳住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（聚精会神地瞄准）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "稳住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（扣下扳机）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！没打中......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "扣扳机不要那么用力，会影响箭矢的轨迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......可能我不是这块料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先别急着说丧气话，这才一个星期，你这准头已经不错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打活物和打固定靶可不太一样，再多练练吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去休息一会儿，一个小时以后进行体能训练。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想要在野外生存，你要学的东西还很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亚历山大先生......还真是厉害啊，你以前是一位军人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看起来可比乌萨斯那些普通士兵靠谱多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我现在依然是军人，只是情况稍微有点复杂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说起来，你老爹今天怎么没来，这都中午了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安瓦尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能是有点什么事耽搁了？"
